      "message": "The --skip-kati flag has some issues. Anton fixed/avoided them in http://ag/q/topic:soongonly but I don\u0027t think they have been cherry picked to AOSP.\n\nThe basic problem was that --skip-kati does not generate all the ninja files that the combined ninja file includes. You can test it by removing all *.ninja file and then running your script. If your script is affected then ninja will fail because it cannot find a file to include.\n\nThis was discovered when an incremental build that changed some environment variable from the previous invocation did not work properly as it included a stale ninja file.\n\nI don\u0027t know if the issues it has affects your use of them or whether you need to/can use the new --soong-only option.",
